ARCHITECTURE (mirrors the A7 ChargingCurve / BatteryHealth precedents)
  GlancePageModel.kt       framework-free: registration ids, GlanceCommands + lock/climate command-name
                           toggles, isVehicleOnline (web `isOnline`), GlanceBatteryBand.forLevel (web
                           `batteryColor` thresholds) + batteryBandFor (muted no-state fallback),
                           GlanceLocation(+fromJson)+kind + locationKindOf (web `getLocationLabel`),
                           resolveGlanceVehicle (web `vehicleId ?? vehicles[0]`), GlanceSnapshot +
                           glanceResource (freshness-preserving Resource projection), resourceFetchedAt,
                           recordGlancePageOpened (view.opened diagnostic).
  GlancePageSource.kt      seam over VehiclesStore.vehicles / vehicleState / locationSnapshotLatest
                           (→ toGlanceLocation parse) + VehicleCommandStore.sendCommand + SelectedVehicleStore.
  GlancePageViewModel.kt   BaseFeedViewModel; uiState: StateFlow<UiState<GlanceSnapshot>> built by
                           combine(refresh, selectedVehicleId) ▸ flatMapLatest(vehicles) ▸ resolve vehicle ▸
                           combine(vehicleState, location) ▸ glanceResource ▸ asUiState(isEmpty = vehicle==null);
                           activeCommand StateFlow + sendCommand (web useVehicleCommand) + refresh/retry.
  GlancePage.kt            stateful entry + stateless content; loading/empty/error/success; GlassPanel1 empty,
                           vehicle name + status Badge, RadialGauge, 4 MetricCards, 3 quick actions,
                           FreshnessIndicator, open-full-app link; pane title = glance.title (web usePageTitle).
  GlancePageIcons.kt       locally-authored 24×24 stroked glyphs (web lucide Battery, Thermometer, Lock,
                           Unlock, MapPin, Wind, Volume2) — TeslaGlyphs ships none of these.
  GlancePageHost.kt        GlanceRoute + GlancePageHost.register() for the `glance` /glance destination
                           (Destinations.kt L50); page-local VehicleCommandStore over the shared client+cache
                           (the DI graph wires no command store yet, as CommandPalette/VehicleCommandCenter note).
  TeslaSyncApplication.kt  GlancePageHost.register() wired into onCreate (NavHost registration).
  res/values/strings.xml   all 20 translation_glance_* keys already present (catalog L3901-3920); no edit needed.

DATA SOURCES (each bound through the ViewModel exposing StateFlow from the KMP core, P1/S8)
  useVehicles              → GlancePageViewModel.uiState ← GlancePageSource.vehicles ← VehiclesStore.vehicles
  useVehicleState          → folded into the snapshot ← GlancePageSource.vehicleState ← VehiclesStore.vehicleState
  useLocationSnapshotLatest→ folded into the snapshot ← GlancePageSource.locationSnapshotLatest
                             ← VehiclesStore.locationSnapshotLatest ▸ toGlanceLocation (raw JSON → GlanceLocation)
  useVehicleCommand        → GlancePageViewModel.sendCommand ← GlancePageSource.sendCommand
                             ← VehicleCommandStore.sendCommand (POST /vehicles/{id}/command; SI verbatim, ADR-013)
  Vehicle resolution: the standalone /glance route carries no vehicle_id arg, so the app-scoped
  SelectedVehicleStore (self-healing to the first enrolled vehicle) plays the web `?vehicle_id=`/`vehicles[0]` role.

